# API origin (no trailing slash). See `.env.development` for the default in `npm run dev`.
#
# With Qwik SSR, Vite's `/api` proxy often does not run for browser fetches — you get 404 on
# :5173 and no requests in API logs. The repo ships `VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080`
# in `.env.development` so calls go straight to the API (enable CORS for http://localhost:5173).
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080
